# TPOL r2: a HOME + hold the player abandons before the ring fills keeps the clip and must not
# launch it. A release past 250 ms is a hold, not a tap: the ring shows ("release: keep"), and
# letting go cancels the clear silently.
wait 300
expect clipused1 1
tap PLAY
wait 200
expect liveclip0 -1
press HOME
key 1 down
wait 1400
shot studio_clear_abort_ring.png
key 1 up
release HOME
wait 120
expect clipused1 1
expect liveclip0 -1
dump studio_clear_abort.json
